      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">How it was scored</h1>
      <p class="lede">The rubric was written before anything was looked at, and the same one was used for all three runs with its weights unaltered. This page is all of it: the fifteen criteria and their weights, the evidence rules, the scores the evaluator revised before reporting, what we corrected before these runs, the fabricated candidate we used as a control, and all three raw outputs with nothing taken out.</p>
